RipsConduit_Constructor
├── when the address does not claim the rips interface
│   ├── given the address is the zero address
│   │   └── it should revert.
│   ├── given the address has no code
│   │   └── it should revert.
│   └── given the address is an unrelated contract
│       └── it should revert.
└── when the address claims the rips interface
    └── it should store the rips address.
